From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 01:21:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add Sqoop jobs -> intermediate YAML converter, API
 endpoint and UI tab

Merges the Sqoop POC's sqoop_to_yaml.py into the framework as agentic/sqoop_yaml.py,
wired the same way as the Spark 2 vs Spark 3 comparison:
- module + CLI (python -m agentic.sqoop_yaml), one run folder under output/
- agent tool sqoop_to_yaml in agentic/code_tools.py
- POST /api/sqoop-yaml in agentic/api.py
- "Sqoop jobs to YAML" tab in ui/compare_app.py

Reuses existing tools instead of duplicating them: agentic.secrets for redaction,
the read-only Trino connector for metadata lookups, spark_compare.load_source and
outputs.new_run_dir. Adds the POC notebooks (password removed, outputs cleared),
the sample Sqoop commands, and tests that check the output matches the YAML the
original script generated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
